  <h1 class="page-title">Privacy policy</h1>
  <p>Last updated: [date]</p>

  <h2>Who is responsible</h2>
  <p>[Artist's legal name], [address], [email], is responsible for the personal data collected on this website.</p>

  <h2>What I collect and why</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Contact form:</strong> your name, email address, subject and message, so I can reply. The form is processed by Netlify, which hosts this site.</li>
    <li><strong>Newsletter:</strong> your email address, so I can tell you about new work and exhibitions. You can unsubscribe at any time.</li>
    <li><strong>Purchases:</strong> your name, email address, shipping address and order details, so I can send the work and keep sales records. Payment is handled by Stripe or PayPal. I never see or store your card details.</li>
    <li><strong>Order emails:</strong> confirmation emails are sent through [email provider, e.g. Resend].</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Analytics</h2>
  <p>This site uses [Cloudflare Web Analytics], which counts visits without cookies and without collecting personal data. There is no cookie banner because the site sets no tracking cookies.</p>

  <h2>Cookies</h2>
  <p>This site sets no cookies. Stripe and PayPal may set cookies on their own payment pages to process your payment safely.</p>

  <h2>How long I keep data</h2>
  <p>Messages: [period]. Newsletter: until you unsubscribe. Sales records: [period, e.g. as long as tax law requires].</p>

  <h2>Who I share data with</h2>
  <p>Netlify (hosting and forms), Stripe and PayPal (payments), [email provider] (order emails) and [courier] (delivery). I do not sell your data.</p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>You can ask to see, correct or delete your data. Contact [email]. You can also complain to [data protection authority].</p>
